来源于一只盘旋的小鸟，可为什么鸟的羽翼上出现了红色墨点？
<<endif>>


:: 观鸟 [bbar] {"position":"2900,700","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>><<set $CurLocation = "天台">><<passTime 10>><</nobr>>你静静地观察着那只鹦鹉。它有着漂亮的绿色羽毛，翅膀上还有一些蓝色的斑纹。鹦鹉似乎很享受这雨天的宁静，不时地用喙梳理着自己的羽毛。

你发现鹦鹉的动作很有规律，它会先整理翅膀，然后是胸前的羽毛，最后是尾巴。这种专注的样子让你感到一种莫名的平静。

突然，一阵风吹过，鹦鹉抖了抖身体，一根绿色的羽毛飘落在你脚边。

<<if !$items.includes("羽毛")>>
[[捡起羽毛->捡羽毛]]
<</if>>
[[继续观察鹦鹉->继续观鸟]]
[[离开->天台]]


:: 触发事件 [bbar] {"position":"3650,850","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>><<script>>
console.log("currentEvent", setup.currentEvent);
if (setup.currentEvent && setup.currentEvent.choices) {
    console.log("currentEvent.choices", setup.currentEvent.choices);
    console.log("choices length", setup.currentEvent.choices.length);
} else {
    console.log("currentEvent or choices not available");
}
<</script>><<if setup.currentEvent && setup.currentEvent.choices && setup.currentEvent.choices.length > 0>>
    <<script>>
    console.log("trigger event done", setup.currentEvent);
    <</script>>
    <<if !setup.currentEvent.isGlobal>>
        <<set $CurLocation = setup.currentEvent.location>>
    <</if>>
    
    <h3><<print setup.currentEvent.title>></h3>
    
    <<print setup.currentEvent.description>>
    
    <<if setup.currentEvent.importance == "high">>
        <div style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">【重要事件】</div>
    <<elseif setup.currentEvent.importance == "normal">>
        <div style="color: orange; font-weight: bold;">【一般事件】</div>
    <<else>>
        <div style="color: green; font-weight: bold;">【可选事件】</div>
    <</if>>

    <<script>>
    console.log("trigger event done ready to choose", setup.currentEvent.importance);
    <</script>>
    
    <br><br>
    你选择：
    <br>
    
    <<set _choiceCount = setup.currentEvent.choices.length>>
    <<for _i = 0; _i < _choiceCount; _i++>>
        <<set _choice = setup.currentEvent.choices[_i]>>
        <<if _choice && _choice.text && (!setup.currentEvent.completedChoices || !setup.currentEvent.completedChoices.includes(_choice.action))>>
            <<capture _i, _choice>>
                <<link _choice.text>>
                    <<set $eventSystem["eventChoice"] = _choice>>
                    <<goto "处理事件选择">>
                <</link>>
                <br>
            <</capture>>
        <</if>>
    <</for>>
    <<nobr>>\
    <<if $CurLocation == "公共吧台">>
        [[返回二楼->二楼]]
    <</if>>
    <</nobr>>
    
<<else>>
    事件加载出错，请返回游戏。
    <<if setup.currentEvent>>
        调试信息：事件存在但选择数组有问题
        <br>事件ID: <<print setup.currentEvent.id || "未知">>
        <br>选择数组: <<print setup.currentEvent.choices ? "存在" : "不存在">>
        <br>选择数量: <<print setup.currentEvent.choices ? setup.currentEvent.choices.length : "N/A">>
    <<else>>
        调试信息：currentEvent变量不存在
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    [[返回夹层（休息室）->夹层（休息室）]]
<</if>>
<</nobr>>


